  <item>
    <title>04面面 - 我也不知道为什么今天那么想笑 可能是因为晒着太阳吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6725d67ecbe0e69c8b8a8b3a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6725d67ecbe0e69c8b8a8b3a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 02 Nov 2024 07:59:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>「📗面面」</span></strong><span>如果你那里在下雨的话，总有一天会天晴的。如果你那里阳光明媚的话，请现在就走出去晒晒太阳叭！一期边走边录的播客。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkpz_QKoTBS0G7XNbHg5AK7Eidb7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【02面面 - 我也不知道为什么今天那么想笑 可能是因为晒着太阳吧】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">3:34</a> 用文字找回对生活的感知</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlAN5evce30YnKe_SIhyj4vcadSA.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 原来我不是一个结果和目标导向的人啊</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 拼命在找自己对目前这份工作的驱动力 原来是</span><em><span>“假如三个月后就离职”</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> </span><em><span>“我现在一直往前走往前走，然后转个弯，来到了一片全是阳光，没有的一点阴的小广场☀️”</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">27:27</a> </span><strong><span>保持好奇</span></strong><span> 不要只停留在“感到好奇”的这一步</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> </span><strong><span>保持探索</span></strong><span> 也许会发现世界是单一的 也许它远比你想象的更丰富</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> </span><strong><span>笑着录音让我的腮帮子有点酸 谢谢每一位关心我的朋友</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【🪽</span><strong><span>本期提及的播客&amp;Vlogger】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>来都来了｜听了再走《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6713d53f3862a5b54258060c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6713d53f3862a5b54258060c"><span>No. 208 - 放弃一时爽，一直放弃一直爽 2.0</span></a><span>》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>岩中花述《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67209efdcbe0e69c8b80ad89" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67209efdcbe0e69c8b80ad89"><span>S6E7 鲁豫对话田晓菲｜「早慧才女」非所望，终盼人生「老更成」</span></a><span>》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>天真不天真《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671f8148db74c60aa4d3bcc5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671f8148db74c60aa4d3bcc5"><span>vol.14 和杜华对谈 解锁女性内驱力 正视自己的野心</span></a><span>》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>@在下小苏 🥟</span><a href="https://weibo.com/1966870313/4604203181288604" data-url="https://weibo.com/1966870313/4604203181288604"><span>weibo.com</span></a><span>｜@曹导 🥡</span><a href="https://weibo.com/1596861115/4525336090021078" data-url="https://weibo.com/1596861115/4525336090021078"><span>weibo.com</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【关于我】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>昕苗/面面。另一档讲亲密关系的播客《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65abbe6aa8f15b5c1caf307b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65abbe6aa8f15b5c1caf307b"><span>Do you?</span></a><span>》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/run12j" data-url="https://okjk.co/run12j"><span>@Yiheunmyo</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3893487526" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3893487526"><span>@Yiheunmyo</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：1329910402@qq.com</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
